{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56280","headline":"题白崖三洞 · 李尧夫","name":"题白崖三洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉州地僻天西南，重叠江山遶城郭。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷一四六《嘉定府》。\n）（按：诗末原署：「唐至和三年李尧夫《题白崖三洞》。\n」至和爲宋仁宗年号，前五字显误。\n尧夫爲蜀人，仁宗时未闻有同名者。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李尧夫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}